  'fim.1':'The Caipora opened the thorn hedge. Ahead runs the Old Chico.', 'fim.2':"The bridge is standing and the Caboclo d'Água went back to the bottom of his pool. Up ahead, Fire Ridge.",
  'fim.final':'{nome} arrived with Estrela in the middle of the Saint John festival, and the whole backlands sang this story in cordel.', 'fim.rosa':' New character unlocked: Rosa, the folk healer!',
